## Red contract (R41)

R41 in `dashboard/__tests__/storytime-print-student-book.test.ts` reads a raster of the letter box. It wants:
- the model letter ink median in the K 20-40 % gray band (153 to 204),
- black ink on the down line and the arch along their paths (fraction at least 0.75),
- one black arrowhead at the end of each stroke (arrow wings at least 2),
- no guide ink outside the letter outline plus 0.5 mm,
- the start dot center at most 2.5 mm below the stem top,
- the down line from at most 2.5 mm below the stem top to at most 2.5 mm above the stem bottom,
- the arch end at most 2.5 mm above the stem bottom.

## First draft

An earlier Green 2d run (coding-plan/glm-5.3-flash, log `jr-green-af9248e.log`) wrote the fix and stopped before a commit. The change sat in the working tree. The Red command therefore no longer failed at the start of this run. This run read the diff, compared it with the contract of R41, and found that the draft matches the copy that the Red test builds itself. The draft was then committed as 4af2f7f2.

## The fix (commit 4af2f7f2)

`dashboard/lib/storytime/print/student-book.ts` only, 10 insertions and 7 deletions:
- the model letter prints in the trace gray #b0b0b0 (K 31 %),
- the guide strokes print in black on top of it,
- the start dot is smaller (r 1.3) and sits at the stem top (cx 40.5, cy 64),
- the arrow marker is 4 units wide,
- the arch follows the arch ink of the letter, so every guide stroke stays inside the letter outline.

